    "set_delete_permanently_confirm_text": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "من الآن فصاعدًا، يؤدي إفراغ سلة GaleriQ إلى حذف الصور والفيديوهات نهائيًا. لن تذهب إلى سلة مهملات Android ولا يمكن استعادتها – ولا من نسخ احتياطية لم تُزامَن بعد. سيسأل Android في كل مرة."
          }
        },
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "From now on, emptying the GaleriQ trash deletes photos and videos for good. They do not go to the Android trash and cannot be restored – also not from backups that have not synced yet. Android still asks each time."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ab jetzt löscht Leeren des GaleriQ-Papierkorbs Fotos und Videos endgültig. Sie kommen nicht in den Android-Papierkorb und lassen sich nicht wiederherstellen – auch nicht aus noch nicht gesicherten Backups. Android fragt trotzdem jedes Mal nach."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "From now on, emptying the GaleriQ trash deletes photos and videos for good. They do not go to the Android trash and cannot be restored – also not from backups that have not synced yet. Android still asks each time."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A partir de ahora, vaciar la papelera de GaleriQ elimina fotos y vídeos para siempre. No van a la papelera de Android y no se pueden recuperar, ni desde copias aún no sincronizadas. Android seguirá preguntando cada vez."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Désormais, vider la corbeille GaleriQ supprime définitivement photos et vidéos. Elles ne vont pas dans la corbeille Android et ne peuvent pas être restaurées – pas même depuis des sauvegardes pas encore synchronisées. Android demande quand même à chaque fois."
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "From now on, emptying the GaleriQ trash deletes photos and videos for good. They do not go to the Android trash and cannot be restored – also not from backups that have not synced yet. Android still asks each time."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Da ora in poi svuotare il cestino di GaleriQ elimina foto e video per sempre. Non finiscono nel cestino di Android e non si possono recuperare, nemmeno da backup non ancora sincronizzati. Android chiede comunque ogni volta."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "今後GaleriQのゴミ箱を空にすると、写真と動画は完全に削除されます。Androidのゴミ箱には入らず、まだ同期されていないバックアップからも復元できません。Androidは毎回確認します。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "이제부터 GaleriQ 휴지통을 비우면 사진과 동영상이 영구 삭제됩니다. Android 휴지통에 들어가지 않으며 아직 동기화되지 않은 백업에서도 복원할 수 없습니다. Android는 매번 확인합니다."
          }
        },
        "nb": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "From now on, emptying the GaleriQ trash deletes photos and videos for good. They do not go to the Android trash and cannot be restored – also not from backups that have not synced yet. Android still asks each time."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vanaf nu verwijdert het legen van de GaleriQ-prullenbak foto’s en video’s definitief. Ze gaan niet naar de Android-prullenbak en zijn niet terug te halen – ook niet uit nog niet gesynchroniseerde back-ups. Android vraagt toch elke keer."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Od teraz opróżnienie kosza GaleriQ trwale usuwa zdjęcia i filmy. Nie trafiają do kosza Androida i nie da się ich przywrócić – także z niezsynchronizowanych kopii. Android i tak zapyta za każdym razem."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "From now on, emptying the GaleriQ trash deletes photos and videos for good. They do not go to the Android trash and cannot be restored – also not from backups that have not synced yet. Android still asks each time."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A partir de agora, esvaziar o lixo do GaleriQ elimina fotos e vídeos de vez. Não vão para o lixo do Android e não podem ser recuperados – nem de cópias ainda não sincronizadas. O Android pergunta sempre."
          }
        },
        "ro": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "De acum, golirea coșului GaleriQ șterge definitiv fotografiile și videoclipurile. Nu ajung în coșul Android și nu pot fi recuperate – nici din copii nesincronizate încă. Android întreabă totuși de fiecare dată."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Теперь очистка корзины GaleriQ удаляет фото и видео навсегда. Они не попадают в корзину Android, восстановить их нельзя – даже из ещё не синхронизированных копий. Android всё равно спросит каждый раз."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "From now on, emptying the GaleriQ trash deletes photos and videos for good. They do not go to the Android trash and cannot be restored – also not from backups that have not synced yet. Android still asks each time."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "From now on, emptying the GaleriQ trash deletes photos and videos for good. They do not go to the Android trash and cannot be restored – also not from backups that have not synced yet. Android still asks each time."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bundan sonra GaleriQ çöp kutusunu boşaltmak fotoğraf ve videoları kalıcı olarak siler. Android çöp kutusuna gitmezler ve geri yüklenemezler – henüz eşitlenmemiş yedeklerden de. Android yine her seferinde sorar."
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Відтепер очищення кошика GaleriQ видаляє фото й відео назавжди. Вони не потрапляють до кошика Android, відновити їх не можна – навіть із ще не синхронізованих копій. Android однаково питатиме щоразу."
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "From now on, emptying the GaleriQ trash deletes photos and videos for good. They do not go to the Android trash and cannot be restored – also not from backups that have not synced yet. Android still asks each time."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "此后清空 GaleriQ 回收站将永久删除照片和视频。它们不会进入 Android 回收站，也无法恢复（包括尚未同步的备份）。Android 仍会每次确认。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "From now on, emptying the GaleriQ trash deletes photos and videos for good. They do not go to the Android trash and cannot be restored – also not from backups that have not synced yet. Android still asks each time."
          }
        }
      }
    },
